{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw, Draw, Pass!</strong> is a chaotic co-op drawing game. The gameplay consists of 1 guesser while the rest of the players are artists. At the beginning of each round, a prompt is chosen and the group is tasked with collaborating their drawing skills for a comprehensive image. After the drawing rounds are completed, the guesser has a chance to guess the prompt. When the round completes, the next round will start and a new guesser will be assigned.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394740?t=1759285401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759285401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394740/81e83122a2825de3b574eee735ed21ccac603d03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759285401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394740/81e83122a2825de3b574eee735ed21ccac603d03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759285401","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw, Draw, Pass!</strong> is a chaotic co-op drawing game. The gameplay consists of 1 guesser while the rest of the players are artists. At the beginning of each round, a prompt is chosen and the group is tasked with collaborating their drawing skills for a comprehensive image. After the drawing rounds are completed, the guesser has a chance to guess the prompt. When the round completes, the next round will start and a new guesser will be assigned.</p>","developers":["Lucky Roll Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3